## 9.8 証明形式の導出

Representative human-readable derivation:

```text
Assume

E²α ∈ 2ι₅∘π_(i+2)(S⁵).

Then

E²(η₂∘α)
=
η₄∘E²α.

Since 2η₄=0,

E²(η₂∘α)=0.

Toda Lemma 4.5, n=3 gives

E(η₂∘α)=0.


Now take α=ν′.

Toda Lemma 5.4 gives

2Eν₄=E²ν′.

Since ν₅=Eν₄,

E²ν′ ∈ 2ι₅∘π_8(S⁵).

Hence

E(η₂∘ν′)=0.


Toda (5.2) and Proposition 5.6 give

π_6^2
=
Z/4{η₂∘ν′}.

Using exactness of

π_8^5 ─Δ→ π_6^2 ─E→ π_7^3,

and E(η₂∘ν′)=0,

Δ is surjective.

Proposition 5.6 gives

π_8^5=Z/8{ν₅}.

Therefore

π_6^2=<Δ(ν₅)>.

Since

π_6^2=Z/4{η₂∘ν′},

we obtain

Δ(ν₅)=±(η₂∘ν′).
```

